                                         osdi:TT_PopulationBaseUtility ,
                                         osdi:TT_PopulationSex ,
                                         osdi:TT_TreatAnnualCost ;
                  osdi:hasDescription "N02. Alternative developments: null progression and a development without risk. The remaining probability cannot be assigned both to a default development and to the null progression." .


